    "Quantum Mob/ Q3 Symbol", "language" -> "en", "paclet" -> "QuantumMob/Q3",
     "status" -> "None", "summary" -> 
    "WickCovariance[ws] returns the n*n covariance matrix \\[CapitalGamma] := \
2 G - I, where G is the single-particle Green's function matrix \
characterizing the Wick state (i.e., fermionic Gaussian pure state without \
pairing correlation), and n is the number of fermion modes in ws. \
WickCovariance[ws, {k1, k2, ..., km}] returns the m*m covariance matrix among \
fermion modes {k1, k2, ..., km} with respect to ws. WickCovariance[data] or \
WickCovariance[data, {k1, k2, ..., km}] shows a dynamic progress indicator \
while calculating the covariance matrices for an (typically large) array data \
of Wick states.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> 
